  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"float:right;max-width: 35%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Cost</b></td>\n<td>$250, 1,000x <a href=\"/index.php/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">wood</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Total Cost</b></td>\n<td>$400\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Production\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Inputs</b></td>\n<td>N/A\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Outputs</b></td>\n<td>8x <a href=\"/index.php/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">coal</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production interval</b></td>\n<td>10 seconds\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Production/Min</b></td>\n<td>48x <a href=\"/index.php/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">coal</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Profit\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$9.60\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>True Profit/Min</b></td>\n<td>$9.60\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Profit/Hour</b></td>\n<td>$576\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Return of Investment/Min</b></td>\n<td>2.4%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>True Return of Investment/Min</b></td>\n<td>2.4%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Aliases\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">coal mine, coalmine\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The coal mine is a facility that produces 8x <a href=\"/index.php/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">coal</a> every 10 seconds. this is best budget option for high profit in early games. it also works very well in mid until late game for Coal Power Plant.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_facilities\">Related facilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Coal_mine&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related facilities\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><b>As Building Material</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Tree_farm\" title=\"Tree farm\">Tree farm</a></li></ul>\n<p><b>As input</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/index.php/Steel_mill\" title=\"Steel mill\">